[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=1236317)[0m - A is not a downstream of C (C->B, no edge from C to A), so A is 0.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=1236317)[0m - D is not a downstream of C (no edge from C to D), so D is 0.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=1236317)[0m - **Result:** A:0, B:1, C:0, D:0 → Consistent with the observation.
