[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=1236317)[0m - B is not a downstream of D (no edge from D to B), so B is 0.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=1236317)[0m - C is not a downstream of D (no edge from D to C), so C is 0.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=1236317)[0m - A is not a downstream of D (no edge from D to A), so A is 0.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=1236317)[0m - **Result:** A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0 → Consistent with the observation.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=1236317)[0m 
